    "name": "Hilton Nagoya",
    "detail": "I stayed here for a weekend in June. It was my first time visiting Japan so I didn't know what to expect but I was pleasantly surprised. Hilton Nagoya was the perfect hotel for me during my stay in Nagoya. I got a great deal on agoda and got a great price on an executive room. I stayed on the 26th floor and as an executive floor bonus, I got free wifi in my room and free breakfast each day. They also offered tea service and dinner drinks and snacks. All the food was great. Also they offered a free shuttle from the hotel to Nagoya station and Nagoya castle (on the weekends). A bus to the airport also stops right in front of the hotel so it was easy to get to the airport.",
