    "name": "Sanco Inn Nagoya Nishiki",
    "detail": "Stayed 4 nights during April. Everything is great. The location just 2 blocks from TV tower and few minutes walk to Subway. Check-in is at 15.00. Be sure to plan your day around this. You can leave your luggage at the hotel and go sightseeing. Breakfast is Japanese style. During my stay, everyday is the same. Steamed Fish, Tofu, Miso Soup and Rice. But It is delicious. There is a coffee machine in front of the elevator, tastes good too. Wifi works well. The hotel also provides Handy, a FREE smart phone witn unlimited calls and internet. You can use as a mobile hotspot. Amazing offer!! BTW, this area is party district (red-light), a lot of people during evening. The hotel has also hot spring/spa. Tips: - You can find the Tourist info center at Oasis on the ground floor, where you can buy 1 day pass for Bus and Subway (600 yen). - Shopping: Don quixote is nearby and opens 24h ",
